{"availability":"available","full":"venom312004/AI-video-assistant","name":"AI-video-assistant","description":"AI-powered meeting/video assistant — transcribes audio/video (English + Hinglish), generates summaries, extracts action items & decisions, and lets you chat with your meeting transcript using RAG. Built with Streamlit, LangChain, Qwen, Whisper & Sarvam AI.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-05T17:23:09Z","updated":"2026-10-07T07:03:54Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-video-assistant-pranjal-pandey-0301.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai-assistants","chromadb","hinglish","langchain","llm","meeting-summarizer","nlp","python","qwen","rag","sarvam-ai","speech-to-text","streamlit","vector-database","whisper"],"demo":"https://ai-video-assistant-pranjal-pandey-0301.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T16:52:54.100Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T16:52:54.100Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T16:52:54.100Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:47.057Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T16:52:54.100Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Meeting Intelligence — Transcribe · Summarise · Chat with your meetings","AI Video Assistant is an end-to-end meeting/video intelligence tool. Upload an audio/video file and it automatically transcribes it (English or Hinglish), generates a summary, extracts action items, key decisions, and open questions, and lets you chat with the transcript using a RAG-powered assistant.","This project combines a dual transcription engine (OpenAI Whisper for English, Sarvam AI for Hinglish), a LangChain + Qwen3 (served by Groq) summarization and extraction pipeline, and a ChromaDB-backed RAG chat system with local embeddings, all wrapped in a custom-styled Streamlit interface."],"features":["🎙️ Dual Transcription Engine — OpenAI Whisper (English) and Sarvam AI (Hinglish)","📋 Auto-Summarization — map-reduce meeting summaries powered by Qwen3 on Groq","✅ Action Item Extraction — tasks, owners, and deadlines pulled automatically","🔑 Key Decision & Open Question Detection — extracted in a single call per transcript chunk","💬 RAG Chat — ask follow-up questions grounded in the transcript"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/venom312004/AI-video-assistant/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ff0333abe2105907bf1cf003b849144e7a1ce7eba10a0a912783b865585afed9","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:47.177Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:47.177Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Meeting Intelligence — Transcribe · Summarise · Chat with your meetings","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/venom312004/AI-video-assistant/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ff0333abe2105907bf1cf003b849144e7a1ce7eba10a0a912783b865585afed9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/venom312004/AI-video-assistant/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:47.177Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T07:03:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/venom312004/AI-video-assistant/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:47.178Z","hash":"ff0333abe2105907bf1cf003b849144e7a1ce7eba10a0a912783b865585afed9","originalBytes":6106,"storedBytes":6106,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:47.057Z","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Chatbots & assistants"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Chatbots & assistants"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Image, audio & video AI","source":"metadata","match":"AI video"},{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"ai assistants"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Apple","Music & audio"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://ai-video-assistant-pranjal-pand